  "| \`.bg-fade-to-r\` | Applies a fade gradient towards the right. |",
  "| \`.bg-fade-to-b\` | Applies a fade gradient towards the bottom. |",
  "| \`.bg-fade-to-l\` | Applies a fade gradient towards the left. |",
  "",
  "### Typography — Heading",
  "",
