  "",
  "### Grid — Base",
  "",
  "| Tailwind \`@utility\` class | Description |",
  "| --- | --- |",
  "| \`.grid-template\` | Applies the responsive Porsche Grid template with named column areas. |",
  "",
  "### Grid — Narrow",
  "",
  "| Tailwind \`@utility\` class | Description |",
