  "| \`.col-start-wide\` | Sets the start position of the wide area within the Porsche Grid. |",
  "| \`.col-end-wide\` | Sets the end position of the wide area within the Porsche Grid. |",
  "",
  "### Grid — Full",
  "",
  "| Tailwind \`@utility\` class | Description |",
  "| --- | --- |",
