  "",
  "### Light",
  "",
  "#### A11y",
  "",
  "| Token | Value | Description |",
  "| --- | --- | --- |",
  "| \`colorFocusLight\` | \`#1A44EA\` | Holds the **focus** color (light), typically used as the outline for \`:focus-visible\` states. |",
