  "# p-spinner accessibility integration examples",
  "",
  "## Integration examples",
  "",
  "### Spinner mounted only when loading starts",
  "",
  "#### ❌ Anti-pattern",
  "",
  "\`\`\`tsx",
  "{isLoading && <PSpinner />}",
  "\`\`\`",
  "",
