  "# p-heading accessibility integration examples",
  "",
  "## Integration examples",
  "",
  "### Skipped heading level",
  "",
  "#### ❌ Anti-pattern",
  "",
  "\`\`\`html",
  "<PHeading tag="h1" size="xl">",
  "  Configure your Porsche",
  "</PHeading>",
  "",
  "<PHeading tag="h4" size="md">",
  "  Delivery options",
  "</PHeading>",
  "\`\`\`",
  "",
  "#### ✅ Recommended",
  "",
