  "| \`$shadow-sm\` | Holds a **small** \`shadow\`. | \`0px 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.16)\` |",
  "| \`$shadow-md\` | Holds a **medium** \`shadow\`. | \`0px 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.16)\` |",
  "| \`$shadow-lg\` | Holds a **large** \`shadow\`. | \`0px 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.16)\` |",
