  "| \`--shadow-md\` | \`.shadow-md\` | Applies a **medium** \`box-shadow\`. | \`0px 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.16)\` |",
  "| \`--shadow-lg\` | \`.shadow-lg\` | Applies a **large** \`box-shadow\`. | \`0px 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.16)\` |",
